{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_06",
  "title": "漩渦",
  "storyCode": "AT-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ba350f16b1f028a85f2706588f41978cf03d6c7fde5a9b8ce36b4ecfa32da1a0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洩氣的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別傻傻站在那裡，這些亡命之徒比嫌疑人還過分！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洩氣的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰不累？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是說，我真的累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟一群社會敗類一起，一群人抓一個人，還*東國粗口*抓不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她連我們的一根頭髮都不願意碰，倒在她刀鞘下的才是真正的敗類，每個人的屁股後面都有案底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她把他們一個個打趴，我們卻和社會敗類一起對付她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惡……該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "惟任那個傢伙只知道一句“會好的”，我從入職到現在已經做了快十年，肩上的章也快換了，真的好了嗎？好個——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張狂的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "條子，躲開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洩氣的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "將吾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洩氣的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "混蛋，你竟然敢襲警？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "張狂的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我剛剛叫你們躲開了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洩氣的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二人面面相覷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "警官，借過一下好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然，我身上的罪名可能會多一條襲警。也許是殺人。我現在不是特別在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "警察嘆了口氣，把空空如也的手從口袋裡伸出來，放在星熊看得見的地方，微微側過身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洩氣的警察",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多謝你幫將吾出了口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重複播放的廣播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鈴、鈴、鈴，林貢斯，林貢斯百貨♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重複播放的廣播",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "古今東西，無所不包，林貢斯百貨♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉客的店員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "時間還早，進來喝一杯吧！像您這樣豪爽的鬼族，最適合本店新進的精釀黑啤——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉客的店員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果您是古典派，我們也有珍藏的芋燒酒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮時髦的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士，請收好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "滾開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮時髦的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何必這麼急躁呢？難道您也在尋找這片大地唯一的珍貴之物——“幸福”的敲門磚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮時髦的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，您是“金石會的青鬼”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮時髦的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以請問一下萌萌香小姐去哪裡了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是她的粉絲？還是想帶著她去找三船領懸賞金？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮時髦的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都不是，我是想請您幫個忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "打扮時髦的男人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可以請您也讓我像這幾天的萌萌香小姐一樣失蹤一次嗎？這樣，我是不是也能像她一樣爆紅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是“青鬼”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“青鬼”小姐，請問可以跟我拍個合照嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "湊熱鬧的路人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦？“青鬼”小姐，等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉客的店員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個，“青鬼”小姐，我們只是一家單純賣酒的店……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“燃島黑”，打包帶走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉客的店員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不好意思，“燃島黑”好幾年前就停產了，同一家工廠出的新產品可以嗎？同樣也是最高級的產品線，保證您滿意——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隨便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "等著店員拿酒的空檔，星熊背靠在店面前，冰冷的眼神掃過前方漸漸聚集起來的人群。\n龍門也好，御機也罷，畢竟城市這麼大。\n哪怕再怎麼位高權重，一個人的死也不可能撼動整個城市所有人的心，更何況一個有名無實的黑幫首領。\n她知道，有人死去，自然有人活著。\n然而這些活著的人們、這座城市，已經和自己沒有任何關係了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有人跟過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就這裡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊扭開瓶蓋，撲鼻的酒精味從瓶子裡溢出來。\n酒甚至沒沾唇，只是聞著那股飄散的味道，她就感到一陣暈眩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐵齋叔，這杯是你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶……賣這麼貴，度數又這麼高的酒，也這麼單薄嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐵齋叔，我這次回御機和人喝酒，一次是在老宅祭奠父親，一次就是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些追著怪談跑的人一定覺得很適合，“青鬼”就該跟死人一起喝酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怪談……哈哈，怪談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在東國的故事，在我不明真相，卻認定了對錯，一腳踏出去之後，就已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那真的是最蠢的事情。哪怕我活了下來，後來老陳也面臨差不多的抉擇，而她也活了下來，我仍然這麼覺得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……提到陳暉潔，鐵齋叔，你們兩個應該認識一下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她當得起俠這個字。炎國也好，東國也罷，只要“俠”這個字還這麼寫，一人挾劍，立於萬軍之前，那就是俠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這杯是敬她的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我和她，不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她膽子很大，不像我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，別說是你，這些話我自己聽起來都覺得彆扭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但怕……就是怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把自己的生死置之度外，於我而言沒什麼難的，但其他人呢？我要保護的人呢？我的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……家呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說實話，事到如今，我該立刻啟程回龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門近衛局的人在東國背了命案，此事非同小可。Missy自然不用說了，林先生、文月夫人，甚至魏先生，恐怕都會為了我的事情而操心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們不會棄我於不顧。我知道他們是什麼樣的人，他們也瞭解我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但這件事畢竟是我惹出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我那個好不容易找到的家，又要被我惹出的麻煩狠狠破壞嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我又有什麼臉，繼續把那個地方稱為“家”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，讓這把刀出鞘，徹底淪為一個鬼——殺人鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殺了金兵衛，殺了敢跟著他向我拔刀的混混，殺了敢攔我的警察……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最終成為雨夜遊蕩在御機街頭的災禍，成為徹徹底底的怪物，成為真正的怪談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "解恨，痛快，順應潮流，擁抱時勢，去當狂歡中最耀眼的瘋子，然後正中他的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，御機所有人的下懷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……無路可走。走什麼路、做什麼事，全都是錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "酒……這麼快就喝完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "星熊小姐酒量不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你的手下呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就我一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐵齋叔的屍身在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "警察已經妥善保存起來了。刀傷致死，而且不是你這把刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你的人還來抓我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上司的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也是來抓我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我來找你喝酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "警察自顧自地盤腿坐下，從口袋裡拿出一個小玻璃杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……嘖，好烈的酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打算曉之以理、動之以情，讓我乖乖跟你進警局，好完成上司給你的任務？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……然後把你弄出御機，讓你老老實實回龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個時候就不聽上司的話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以為我為什麼在你剛進御機的時候就派人抓你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二十年前在龍門犯下要案的黑道高層重返龍門，換成是我，也會抓住他好好問個清楚的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "僅此而已？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然還能因為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "警察盯著星熊的眼睛看。\n在發現對面的人並不是在隱瞞，也不是在開玩笑之後，他毫無預兆地朝著星熊的臉來了一拳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真虧你忘得了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年死在你們金石會手裡的那個議員候選人，他也姓惟任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這拳是為我叔叔打的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是你為了黑道的*東國粗口*俠義自己承擔了多年的罪名，他的事也不會沉寂這麼多年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "道歉早就沒用了。我現在拿三船無計可施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個傢伙早就找了一位炙手可熱的議員當靠山。不然你以為，光憑一個黑道的身分，他就敢在警察局呼來喝去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把你放走，讓他不能稱心如意，我能做到的事——警察能做到的事，也就這麼多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後，鐵齋叔的死會成為青鬼和兇宅怪談的最後一個註腳，一切都會像當年一樣不了了之，是嗎？“靈務局”的惟任刑警。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你嘴上說不讓他稱心如意，但你做的事不就是在幫他嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你懷疑怪談和三船有關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好像不是很驚訝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“靈務局”的條子也是條子，條子是有嗅覺的。哪怕被鐵鏈死死拴著，我也能聞到腐肉的氣味從哪裡飄過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "然後你就跟鐵鏈和解了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是每個人都和你一樣，一個人吃炸肉排飯吃飽了，全家就都不餓了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道御機一間連轉身都很困難，卻要住一家四口的房子，到底要多少錢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不太想猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你願意幫我一口氣還完貸款，幫我把我的老婆小孩接到龍門，我當然可以把你家老宅翻個徹徹底底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或者，如果這麼做真的能一擊斃命，徹底打倒三船，我也不是不願意冒險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在輪到你回答我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是打算幫我還完我這輩子都不一定還得完的貸款呢，還是有比議員更大的勢力，能徹底推翻三船？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經在盡我所能幫你了。別不識好歹，青鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "警察激憤地仰頭，喝光了最後一點酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給我一個你不能走的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……熊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼誰？你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……星熊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幽靈小姐！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是萌萌香？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "惟任，你聽到萌萌香的聲音了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌香？那個偶像？她不是一直和你在一起嗎？我還要問你把她藏到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊朝著聲音傳來的方向狂奔而去。\n惟任嘆了口氣，緊緊跟在星熊後面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒人？但是聲音明明就越來越近了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香的聲音",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這邊！這邊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌香？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……你怎麼被關在電視裡了？\n這句話星熊和惟任刑警都沒問出口。\n兩人面前，一家店面根本看不出做什麼生意，連有沒有營業都不知道的小店外，擺著一台破破爛爛的電視。\n披頭散髮的萌萌香在裡面朝著星熊大叫。\n她眼睛沒在看星熊，一隻手還敲著她前面的什麼東西，怎麼看都像在敲電視螢幕，彷彿隨時都會從裡面爬出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是星熊對吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我！你看不到我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看不到你，但我聽到你說話了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了，真的太好了……我以為一切都已經沒救了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗚嗚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你先別哭，你到底在哪裡？這台電視現在放的是什麼地方的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是金兵衛的巢穴，我和吉星被他關起來了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "滋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "萌萌香？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "電視螢幕忽然一片漆黑。\n冷風無端從樓間吹來，腰間的刀在鞘中嗡鳴嗚咽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "惟任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐵齋叔剛死，我的心很亂。我忘了一些事情。這是我不對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你呢？你真的覺得萌萌香被我藏起來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有吉星。她對你們來說想必也無足輕重。一個只知道打小鋼珠的廢人罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "星熊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為了把我這顆災星安安穩穩地送走，一個兩個無關緊要的人，反正已經和金兵衛扯上了關係，乾脆不管了，是這樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們會儘量確保那兩個人的生命安全——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兇宅的受害者、鐵齋叔、前幾天被砍倒在鍛冶町的金兵衛的手下……你們有哪次做到過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊揮出一拳，同樣打在刑警的臉上。\n這一拳太重，打得刑警踉踉蹌蹌往後退了幾步，但還是撐著沒有倒下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不稱職，這點不用你提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我要說的是，你不是災星。你是我手中唯一一張能讓三船感受到痛、感受到他在御機不是無所不能的牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "半路把我放走就好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是警察能做到的極限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "警察，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也是警察。你知道警察的極限在哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "星熊，聽我說句話吧。回龍門。你的那個“同鄉”，還有龍門近衛局，他們會幫你擺平這些事情的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊下意識地把手伸到口袋裡。那裡放著龍門近衛局的證件。\n但她同樣摸到一團軟軟的東西。鐵齋遞給她的、般若上拆下來的綁帶。朋友們送來的禮物。心意。\n她忽然無端聞到汐斯塔的海風味。\n維多利亞原野上潮濕的草堆味。\n龍門下城區食肆的香味。\n……鍛冶町越來越濃烈的、只有老房子才有的木材的氣息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "知道我說得對，那就快點——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是說，“龍門近衛局會幫我擺平這些事情”那句，你說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我之前好像有點太瞻前顧後……或者說，太怕給朋友們添麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊沒有回答，而是連刀鞘一起把刀從腰間卸下，將軟帶一圈一圈地纏在刀柄上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要用這把刀？你到底想做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還有個承諾沒兌現呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要去救人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別傻了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我就這樣狼狽地逃回龍門，Missy大概會氣到住院，林雨霞的話，我這輩子都別想在她面前抬起頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於老陳……我還等著用重鑄好的般若跟赤霄打一架呢。總不能空著手回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不怕這把刀出鞘之後，你又像二十年前那樣後悔一生嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鐵齋叔說般若中其實融著僧院的秘法，但我的心性不足，壓不住鬼族血脈中的狂性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，說什麼心性、秘法……惟任，你不覺得這些都太虛無縹緲了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二十年前如果真的有秘法，事情會變成什麼樣，我不知道，我也不關心。但此時此刻，我不需要什麼秘法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要這個綁帶還被我握在手裡，星熊就絕不會淪為只知道殺戮的惡鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於後悔，我後悔的是，非要把一切背在自己背上，非要讓自己來扛，卻又一廂情願地想讓自己的犧牲有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你現在到底覺得自己是警察還是黑道？哪個身分要求你非這麼做不可？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "警察？黑道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟這些沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我答應過萌萌香，就這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，還有，既然要去救人……我八成會遇到三船。就算沒遇到，我也會去找他的。我有事要問他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "從警察深陷的眼窩和濃重的黑眼圈中，星熊分明看見一束銳利的光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會和他打？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不想打，但應該也逃不掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幫我在那個傢伙身上劃一刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用你拜託。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，劃一刀就夠了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最後重複一次，我是一名警察啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我先回警局了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要不出人命，從上面來的壓力，我會想辦法擋下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感謝之情，無以言表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但願我值得你這麼重的一句感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
